{
    "title": "Whoosh",
    "description": "Rent e-scooters with Whoosh, your best friend for fast rides around the city.\r\nWhoosh helps you get where you want without getting stuck in traffic, and it's fun!\r\n\r\nSCOOTER RIDES\r\nIt's easy to reserve scooters and get riding with our free mobile app\r\n\u2014 super fast registration\r\n\u2014 find the closest scooter on the map\r\n\u2014 in the app, scan the QR code on the scooter to unlock it\r\n\u2014 track your ride progress: total time, speed, rental zones and other important information\r\n\u2014 end your ride in any parking area marked with a \"P\" on the map\r\n\u2014 now the scooter is available for the next Whoosher\r\n\r\nThe app lets you reserve scooters for free and rent multiple scooters on one account to ride with friends.\r\n\r\nThe app helps you on every step. It's important for us that your scooter rides are safe and exciting, and that our service is easy to understand and perfect.\r\nJust tap a scooter in the app to read more about the model.\r\n\r\nOTHER COOL STUFF:\r\n\u2014 speed up to 20 km/h\r\n\u2014 bright headlight for night rides\r\n\u2014 full battery charge lasts 30 km\r\n\u2014 you don't need to charge scooters, we do that\r\n\u2014 easy to ride for anyone over 18 years old\r\n\u2014 GPS tracking and detailed ride statistics\r\n\u2014 rent by the minute\r\n\u2014 all scooter parking areas are marked on the map in the app\r\n\r\nYou can contact our Support team in the in-app chat around the clock. If you have any questions, message us!\r\n\r\nHave fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rent e-scooters with Whoosh, your best friend for fast rides around the city.<br>Whoosh helps you get where you want without getting stuck in traffic, and it&#39;s fun!<br><br>SCOOTER RIDES<br>It&#39;s easy to reserve scooters and get riding with our free mobile app<br>\u2014 super fast registration<br>\u2014 find the closest scooter on the map<br>\u2014 in the app, scan the QR code on the scooter to unlock it<br>\u2014 track your ride progress: total time, speed, rental zones and other important information<br>\u2014 end your ride in any parking area marked with a &quot;P&quot; on the map<br>\u2014 now the scooter is available for the next Whoosher<br><br>The app lets you reserve scooters for free and rent multiple scooters on one account to ride with friends.<br><br>The app helps you on every step. It&#39;s important for us that your scooter rides are safe and exciting, and that our service is easy to understand and perfect.<br>Just tap a scooter in the app to read more about the model.<br><br>OTHER COOL STUFF:<br>\u2014 speed up to 20 km/h<br>\u2014 bright headlight for night rides<br>\u2014 full battery charge lasts 30 km<br>\u2014 you don&#39;t need to charge scooters, we do that<br>\u2014 easy to ride for anyone over 18 years old<br>\u2014 GPS tracking and detailed ride statistics<br>\u2014 rent by the minute<br>\u2014 all scooter parking areas are marked on the map in the app<br><br>You can contact our Support team in the in-app chat around the clock. If you have any questions, message us!<br><br>Have fun!",
